========================================================================
             GOURMET CULINARY ACADEMY — TEST & EVALUATION INFO
========================================================================

PROJECT OVERVIEW:
This web application is a Cooking School Management & Enrollment System.
Built with Python (Flask), SQLite3, HTML5, and CSS3.

------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. SIMULATED TIME & DAY FOR EVALUATION
------------------------------------------------------------------------
The system assumes the current system time is set to:
  - Day: Monday
  - Time: 09:00

