------------------------------------------------------------------------
4. HOW TO RUN THE APPLICATION LOCALLY
------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Install dependencies:
   pip install -r requirements.txt

2. Initialize database schema & test data:
   python init_db.py

3. Run Flask development server:
   python app.py

4. Open browser at:
   http://127.0.0.1:5000/
